  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Stainless steel case with a stainless steel bracelet. Fixed stainless steel bezel. Black dial with luminous silver-tone leaf-style hands and diamond hour markers. Roman numerals appear at the 3, 6, 9 and 12 o'clock positions. Minute markers around the outer ring. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 3 o'clock position. ETA caliber 2671 automatic movement, containing 25 Jewels, bitting at 28800 vph, and has a power reserve of approximately 38 hours. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape. Case size: 25.3 mm. Case thickness: 8.4 mm. Band width: 12 mm. Butterfly clasp. Water resistant at 30 meters / 100 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second. Casual watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot Le Locle Automatic Black Diamond Dial Ladies Watch T41.1.183.56.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Le Locle</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T41.1.183.56</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Women's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"paddin